      "side": 1,
      "message": "Before this patch this path was basically dead. But after this patch the channel sits at-or-above the high water mark for significant time during bulk advertisement. ChannelOutputLimiter is supposed to gate that behaviour, but there are 3 other callers reaching this method without going through the Limiter. Thus they don\u0027t wait for the channel to drain first. Reinvestigate please and make sure it\u0027s safe.",
      "revId": "66724b23c36781a148ed887ca713031204c10013",
      "serverId": "7fc14799-209e-464c-9743-7a06c2c21a81"
    },
